# S'more Skills camp sync

## Never

- Reuse Guildie Crafts prefixes (`GuildieCft`, `GCftV2`, `GCftF`, `GCftFV2`)
- Send camp pings outside the guild until a dedicated channel is designed
- Apply a camp from the other faction
- Let more than three object slots exist on a camp
- Dump every stored camp with no cap or cooldown (freezes clients)
- Treat newest packet as truth when `updatedAt` is older
- Scan the whole continent for fires — addons only see what is in range or what others share

## Required

- Prefix `SmoreSk`. Payload under 250 bytes: `C:map:x:y:fac:own:p1:o1:p2:o2:p3:o3:t`
- Same-faction only
- Three slots. Each player places at most one object (enforced by the game; we display it)
- Login asks (`Q`) then others share, rate-limited, newest first, cap 12
- Forget camps older than 30 minutes
- Manual `/smores here` until we can enumerate a campfire object
- `## Interface:` and `_forever_` path are placeholders until beta FrameXML is known
